{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a001", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-a4fbb4"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "Amsterdam の順序（遊び→忌避→自己顕示→印認識）を一節として引用し、§2-01 で解釈した。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a002", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-1375a6"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Rochat 五水準の公開抄録を読み、四層解離層解離説との軸の違いを §2-02 で解釈した。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a003", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-5417eb"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "Main & Hesse の不統合・FR 行為の要約を引用し、二者較正説の破綻条件として §2-03 で解釈。EVL-20261124-170204 の根拠。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a004", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-6608db"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Sroufe の適応の質による連続を、Q-002 への第三の応答として §2-04 で解釈。保留（§3-6）。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a005", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-4b16e5"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Kaye のターンテイキングと自己四段階を、二者較正の具体化と四層の手前として §2-05 で解釈。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a006", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-94feb1"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Hart & Risley の量の軸を、質の話の手前として §2-06 で解釈。分離設計なし（保留 §3-5）。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a007", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-c4cf72"}, "reading": "summarized", "note": "Kohlberg の段階基準（質的差・不可逆・構造 d'ensemble）を二次記述から要約し、書庫の加法/入れ替えの区別に §2-07 で接続。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a008", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-4e4b17"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Overton の関係的発達システムを、単位選択のメタ理論として §2-08 で解釈。転用は類推と明記。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261124-45a009", "session_id": "SESSION-20261124-8cecc8", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261124-0e57f2"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Stern の調律（どう／形式同期）を、二者較正の内容規定と read_log の欄不在として §2-09 で解釈。", "created_at": "2026-11-24"}
